# has no target left on resolution and is countered (CR 608.2b); it does nothing to Bot1's life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Ornithopter
Village Rites
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
